  (text "10 — USB-C PD POWER INPUT"
    (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) (bold yes)) (justify left))
    (uuid "cf000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000384"))
  (text "Dedicated power-only USB-C: GCT USB4085-GF-A → TVS2200 / TPD4S201 → TPS25730AD integrated 5A sink path → PD_PWR."
    (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 17 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.78 0.78) (bold yes)) (justify left))
    (uuid "cf000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000385"))
  (text "Pin straps: ADCIN1=3 (15V minimum), ADCIN2=6 + PD5VMAX=0 (20V maximum, auto-disable on capability mismatch), ADCIN3=3 / ADCIN4=3 (3A operating, 5A maximum)."
    (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 21 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.69 0.69)) (justify left))
    (uuid "cf000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000386"))
  (text "This makes 45W the guaranteed minimum accepted PD contract while permitting up to 100W from a 20V/5A source. Rev-A policy must conservatively budget PD operation until negotiated-contract telemetry is added."
    (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.69 0.69)) (justify left))
    (uuid "cf000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000387"))
  (text "TPS25730AD is VBUS-only powered here: VIN_3V3 is tied to GND. I2C is intentionally grounded per TI guidance when unused; future telemetry must use a power-safe isolation/buffer interface."
    (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 29 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.69 0.69)) (justify left))
    (uuid "cf000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000388"))
  (text "USB2 D+/D- and SBU are unused on this dedicated POWER receptacle. CC1/CC2 use TPD4S201 short-to-VBUS/ESD protection; VBUS uses TVS2200 flat-clamp protection plus D30 Schottky clamp for cable-disconnect surge current per TI guidance."
    (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 33 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.69 0.69)) (justify left))
    (uuid "cf000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000389"))
  (text "U8/U9 and U7 REF0038A footprints are native-validated green. D30 now uses KiCad TO-252-2_Rectifier for ST DPAK (pad 1=A, pad 2=K/tab, pad 3=NC) and awaits native validation; exact capacitor MPNs remain separate physical-freeze items."
    (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 190 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.69 0.69) (bold yes)) (justify left))
    (uuid "cf000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000390"))

